   "id": 366173,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>Your manager at WorldCorp has asked you to summarize information for various models of one of the company’s products. You are given the following information:</p>\n<img class=\"scaled-down\" src=\"exercises/media/1637ae873af7961a.jpg\" alt=\"Table information: Model column: RX-500, RX-600, RX-700, RS-99, RS-100. Price column: $17.99, $25.99, $35.99, $99.00, $114.99. Units Sold column: 5000, 4000, 3000, 2000, 1000. Bottom row reads: Total Revenue: $614,870.00.\">\n<p>Using this data and the skills learned in this and previous chapters, construct a short email/informal memo to your manager. Include a link to the Excel chart that summarizes the information provided.</p>",
